{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>You shall not sacrifice to YHWH your Elohim.</b> Now just as He mentioned the Asherah and the pillar, He mentioned that it is likewise forbidden to sacrifice to His name any animal with a blemish." "<b>Any evil thing.</b> Meaning a blemish." "<b>For it is an abomination.</b> Like the sense of \"offer it now to your governor\" (Malachi 1:8). And there is punishment for sacrificing it, but there is no punishment for one who does not sacrifice at all, aside from the obligation."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:23:44.383275809Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}